## Context

The author requested the v8 rewrite, a PR, an independent Astra review with
"simple, portable, efficace", and merge. Publish the repository-Markdown
architecture and its delivery plan, preserving v7 and current implementation
state. This ticket owns the planning change only; it does not close 0909 or
claim any capture, timer or runtime deployment.

## Exit criteria

- [ ] The current design is v8: repository Markdown/Git, factual positive and negative roar capture, annual append-only journal, weekly dreaming and reviewed crystallisation; no mandatory embedding, database, MCP or hoard implementation.
- [ ] V7 design and implementation plan are preserved as historical snapshots.
- [ ] The active delivery plan and ticket dependencies agree; obsolete work is held, existing logs preserved, and implementation tickets remain open.
- [ ] Docs index, ROADMAP and STATE point to v8 without claiming runtime deployment; unrelated portability/model work is excluded.
- [ ] Applicable checks pass and independent Astra review findings are dispositioned against the final diff before merge.
